<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Choice Holdings weighing rights issue.</title>
<headline>Choice Holdings weighing rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Choice Holdings Ltd said on Friday that discussions were taking place regarding the recapitalisation of the concern via a rights issue.</p>
<p>It urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
